[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429350\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429735\">7210E22</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the screen washer fluid pipe.</p><p>2. Remove jet  (2a), releasing the retainers (2b). It is not possible\nto adjust the jets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044982.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the jet using retainers.</p><p>Connec the screen washer pipe.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429735\">7210E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429350\">5050B34</a></p>"]]